From 8dbb0481fbd19768d20dba6d1d9c3f8af0e20855 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brhett <36874370+jingledingle521@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:17:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 23/36] Finder: consistent Recents (title, columns), group
 headers, no stray chevrons

- Recents is titled "Recents" like the sidebar, and lists Date Last
  Opened, Size and Kind like any other folder.
- Group titles are semibold with a hairline under each group; grouped
  lists have no zebra stripes (rows restart per group).
- Disk images and archives that KIO lists as folders show as files: no
  disclosure chevron, and "--" for an unknown size.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KdkdNUmoM62iDwjRop6X5f
---
 src/finder/finderchrome.cpp                     |  8 ++++++++
 src/kitemviews/kfileitemlistwidget.cpp          |  4 +++-
